OL,3,GNEWSATravel disruption during railway
OL,4,Abridge repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers are being warned to
OL,7,Fexpect disruption to services ahead of
OL,8,Fthe August bank holiday weekend caused
OL,9,Fby bridge repair works.
OL,11,FNetwork Rail said the work on
OL,12,FBrotherton Bridge, near Knottingley,
OL,13,Fwould affect some services in the area
OL,14,Ffrom Saturday to Monday.
OL,16,FThe #800,000 upgrade is set to replace
OL,17,Fold sections of the track and provide
OL,18,Fessential repairs to the bridge.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
